	"data": "Godot VR Editor Proposal (#12086)\n\nOpen proposal to rework the Godot VR editor with floating windows in 3D space. The gap we're filling.\nURL: <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12086>\nState: Open\nAuthor: astearon (March 2025)\nLabels: topic:editor, topic:xr\n\nWhat It Proposes\nEditor panels as floating windows in 3D space (like Unreal's VR editor mode)\nWindows can be world-locked or follow the user\nJoystick navigation, grip-to-zoom (Tilt Brush style)\nTriggers as mouse buttons,…",
